This product implements the Linked Open Knowledge Format (LOKF) specification:
https://lokf.nolan-nichols.com/specification/

LOKF is a semantic profile of the Open Knowledge Format (OKF) specification by
Google Cloud Platform:
https://github.com/GoogleCloudPlatform/knowledge-catalog/blob/main/okf/SPEC.md

LOKF Enforcer is a companion plugin to an installed OKF v0.2 validator (such as
OKF Enforcer) and does not itself implement OKF's core frontmatter, provenance,
trust, or lifecycle rules.
